===Etymology===
From {{inh|fi|fiu-fin-pro|*soola}} (compare {{cog|et|sool}}, {{cog|vep|sol}}), ultimately borrowed from {{der|fi|ine-pro|*séh₂ls}}. Words of the same origin occur also in many other Uralic languages, for example {{cog|koi|сов}}, {{cog|udm|сылал}}.

